Z||000039||mrfiero||03-17-2001||03:41 AM||||Chadman,<P>Carl's Jr is working it's way east......we have quite  few here in the Denver area.  Maybe they'll make Ohio soon?? <P>Heck, a Del-Taco (another west coast operation) just opened up here in Brighton......I think it's the first one in Colorado (they sell burgers too).  I haven't tried their burgers, but they look OK.<BR> <BR>In-N-out is pretty good too, but I haven't eaten there in a few years.  We have Good Times here in Denver.  I think it's just a Colorado company, but they rival In-N-Out and Carl's Jr......pretty good!  ||||reg||10
Z||000040||stimpy||03-17-2001||10:50 PM||||In-N-Out must have my vote for THE BEST! burgers and fries.  I love the menu, whatever you want as long as its a hamburger, a cheeseburger, or a double cheseburger. I miss em. But I gotta say, what I miss the very most from California (aside from decent Mexican food) is my beloved Round Table Pizza! NOTHING can compare to Round Table. Californians are so spoiled.||||reg||1
